libccontainer
------------------------------------------
Various data structures in plain C

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libccontainer-devel-1.0.1+git20190103-1bl2
  libccontainer0-1.0.1+git20190103-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  CUnit-2.1.3-1
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/snegovick/libccontainer

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/snegovick/libccontainer.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libccontainer-1.0.1+git20190103-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libccontainer-1.0.1+git20190103-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libccontainer-1.0.1+git20190103-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libccontainer-1.0.1+git20190103-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libccontainer0-1.0.1+git20190103-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libccontainer-devel-1.0.1+git20190103-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libccontainer)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libccontainer.README
  /usr/share/doc/libccontainer/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libccontainer/README.md

(libccontainer0)
  /usr/bin/cygccontainer-0.dll

(libccontainer-devel)
  /usr/include/libccontainer/cdynstorage.h
  /usr/include/libccontainer/chash.h
  /usr/include/libccontainer/circularbuf.h
  /usr/include/libccontainer/clist.h
  /usr/include/libccontainer/clist_common.h
  /usr/lib/libccontainer.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libccontainer.pc

